---
description: Prefer flat code with small functions and early returns
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer early returns and guard clauses to avoid deep nesting.
- Split complex logic into multiple small, focused functions.
- Avoid large nested `{ ... }` blocks; extract helpers instead of deep `if/else` or `match` pyramids.
- Keep indentation shallow; return early rather than wrapping the remainder in `else`.

